OLMo-2-7B & \texttt{allenai/OLMo-2-1124-7B-Instruct} & 7B \\
InternLM2.5-7B & \texttt{internlm/internlm2\_5-7b-chat} & 7B \\
DeepSeek-7B & \texttt{deepseek-ai/deepseek-llm-7b-chat} & 7B \\
\bottomrule
